43
00:06:31,725 --> 00:06:33,353
- Okay.
- Thanks.

44
00:06:39,232 --> 00:06:40,495
What you do at the that gym?

45
00:06:40,667 --> 00:06:43,899
Well, I usually start out
with a stair-climbing machine.

46
00:06:44,070 --> 00:06:45,766
I got stairs here.

47
00:06:45,939 --> 00:06:50,172
You can run up and down them
for free. Save you $600 a year.

48
00:06:51,878 --> 00:06:55,542
Then I ride the stationary bike.

49
00:06:56,549 --> 00:06:58,245
What's the matter with
the bike I gave you?

50
00:06:58,418 --> 00:07:00,910
You gave me that when I was 12.

51
00:07:01,087 --> 00:07:02,988
This is state-of-the-art
equipment.

52
00:07:04,357 --> 00:07:08,294
Boy, you're just kicking and screaming
your way into the '90s, aren't you?

53
00:07:08,461 --> 00:07:11,090
- What are you talking about?
- You hate change.

54
00:07:11,264 --> 00:07:13,961
Practically had to put you into
