127
00:14:11,851 --> 00:14:14,844
I'm just admitting that I've given up
hope of ever getting anything back.

128
00:14:15,021 --> 00:14:18,485
Well... I guess I
can understand that.

129
00:14:19,692 --> 00:14:22,093
- You really wanna cheer me up?
- You know I do.

130
00:14:22,261 --> 00:14:25,663
Great. Let's go
buy you a new suit.

131
00:14:25,832 --> 00:14:27,460
That'd just thrill me.

132
00:14:50,256 --> 00:14:52,316
Oh.

133
00:14:52,492 --> 00:14:54,688
This is a nice one.

134
00:14:54,861 --> 00:14:56,386
Too heavy. Make me sweat.

135
00:14:57,563 --> 00:14:59,122
Why do you hate this so much?

136
00:14:59,298 --> 00:15:01,096
Well, first of all, I
don't need a new suit.

137
00:15:01,267 --> 00:15:02,496
Here we go.

138
00:15:02,668 --> 00:15:06,400
And I have to go in one of
these little rooms and try it on.

139
00:15:06,572 --> 00:15:10,873
They got pins all over the
floor and these little doors.

140
00:15:11,978 --> 00:15:13,879
The doors on the
