141
00:15:14,046 --> 00:15:17,778
They come down to my knees,
and you know I've got chicken legs.

142
00:15:17,950 --> 00:15:20,852
- You have great legs.
- Can I be of some assistance?

143
00:15:21,020 --> 00:15:23,888
- What kind of suit are you looking for?
- Something that won't wrinkle.

144
00:15:24,056 --> 00:15:27,117
My dad is a
conservative dresser.

145
00:15:27,293 --> 00:15:30,923
Do you have anything in a classic cut?
Maybe a dark wool blend of some kind.

146
00:15:31,097 --> 00:15:34,226
You know, we just got
in the most fabulous suit.

147
00:15:34,834 --> 00:15:36,462
Aah...

148
00:15:37,236 --> 00:15:39,102
Rudolfo Stefanelli.

149
00:15:39,272 --> 00:15:41,537
In my opinion, the finest
designer in Europe today.

150
00:15:41,707 --> 00:15:43,175
What do you think?

151
00:15:44,143 --> 00:15:46,408
I paid less for my first house.

152
00:15:53,319 --> 00:15:55,879
- I think you'll love this cut.
- What is it?

153
00:15:56,055 --> 00:15:57,318
Half off.

154
00:16:04,230 --> 00:16:05,755
Try this on right now.

155
00:16:32,291 --> 00:16:34,260
<i>September ninth.</i>

156
00:16:34,427 --> 00:16:37,761
<i>I had the most
bizarre reaction today.</i>

157
00:16:37,930 --> 00:16:40,161
<i>I was in Tattinger's
Lingerie Shop</i>

158
00:16:40,333 --> 00:16:45,704
<i>and I was staring at the sexiest
piece of lingerie I think I'd ever seen.</i>

159
00:16:46,639 --> 00:16:48,665
<i>Six hundred dollars.</i>

160
00:16:48,841 --> 00:16:50,969
<i>I almost bought it too.</i>

161
00:16:51,143 --> 00:16:54,739
<i>But there is this little voice
inside of me that kept saying:</i>

162
00:16:54,914 --> 00:16:57,975
<i>"Leanne, there is something
wrong with a woman</i>

163
00:16:58,150 --> 00:17:01,120
<i>buying herself
expensive lingerie."</i>

164
00:17:10,196 --> 00:17:12,062
Okay, okay, okay, you
drive a hard bargain,

165
00:17:12,231 --> 00:17:14,029
I'll only write glowing
things about you,

166
00:17:14,200 --> 00:17:17,329
and I'll list your age as five
years younger than you really are.

167
00:17:17,503 --> 00:17:20,234
- You remember me, don't you?
- Well, it's hard not to.

168
00:17:20,406 --> 00:17:22,932
You happen to be wearing
my favorite men's cologne.

169
00:17:23,109 --> 00:17:24,577
See? We're compatible.

170
00:17:24,744 --> 00:17:27,373
Come on, Leanne,
let me interview you.

171
00:17:27,547 --> 00:17:28,708
How long will this take?

172
00:17:28,881 --> 00:17:32,215
It depends on how completely
and thoroughly engaging you are.

173
00:17:32,385 --> 00:17:34,217
Great. That'll be short.

174
00:17:34,387 --> 00:17:35,912
- Leanne!
- I'm right here, Dad.

175
00:17:36,088 --> 00:17:37,954
- Jury's in.
- I'll be right there.

176
00:17:38,891 --> 00:17:41,952
I can do it. How
about 3 this afternoon?

177
00:17:42,128 --> 00:17:44,029
Perfect. It's a
beautiful day out.

178
00:17:44,964 --> 00:17:46,724
- Let's say we meet at Freiman Park?
- Great.

179
00:17:46,766 --> 00:17:49,395
Yeah. I'll pick up some
pastries. Do you like Linzer torte?

180
00:17:49,569 --> 00:17:51,333
Excuse me?

181
00:17:51,504 --> 00:17:54,440
I was asking you if
you liked Linzer torte?

182
00:17:55,374 --> 00:17:57,866
I make Linzer torte.
It's my favorite dessert.

183
00:17:59,245 --> 00:18:00,440
How about that?

184
00:18:01,714 --> 00:18:03,478
Well, I'll see you around 3.

185
00:18:07,186 --> 00:18:08,518
That's amazing.

186
00:18:12,124 --> 00:18:14,992
Members of the jury,
have you reached a verdict?

187
00:18:18,531 --> 00:18:19,658
We have, Your Honor.

188
00:18:19,832 --> 00:18:23,633
We find the defendant,
Steven Dixon, guilty.

189
00:18:24,170 --> 00:18:27,231
The defendant will return
to this courtroom at 9:00

190
00:18:27,406 --> 00:18:29,341
on the tenth of this
month for sentencing.

191
00:18:30,076 --> 00:18:31,203
This court is adjourned.

192
00:18:45,625 --> 00:18:47,958
I guess I oversold
